<h1>About Us</h1>
<p>Hoops 'n Soles is a youth-led charity based in West Vancouver, Canada. We collect gently used athletic shoes from the Greater Vancouver community and donate them to kids and teens who need them.</p>
<p>Our mission is to move good shoes from closets to kids, so everyone can play, move, and feel confident. We focus on basketball shoes but also accept runners and athletic shoes of all types.</p>
<p>Founded by students who believe in the power of sport and community, Hoops 'n Soles operates through donations, volunteers, and partnerships with local schools and organizations.</p>
